---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - AmerisPro">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <header class="legal-header">
        <span class="legal-badge">📜 Master Subscription Agreement</span>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-subtitle">
          Please review these Terms of Service governing your access to and use of the 
          <strong>AmerisPro Safety Hub SaaS Platform</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="legal-meta">
          <span>Effective Date: July 25, 2026</span> • <span>Version 2.0</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">
        
        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. Service Access & 14-Day Free Trial</h2>
          <p>
            By creating an account, logging in via Google OAuth, or accessing the AmerisPro platform ("Service"), you agree to these Terms of Service.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>14-Day Free Trial:</strong> All new workspace registrations receive a 14-day free trial period with zero payment required upfront.</li>
            <li><strong>Trial Feature Allowances:</strong> Free trial workspaces receive access to all core modules and a trial allowance of AI search and analytics queries.</li>
            <li><strong>Subscription Expiration:</strong> Upon expiration of the 14-day trial, an active Premium Subscription is required to maintain full edit and administrative access.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. Subscriptions & Payments</h2>
          <p>
            AmerisPro offers paid SaaS subscription tiers. Payments are securely processed via licensed payment partners supporting FPX Online Banking, eWallets, and Debit/Credit Cards.
          </p>
          <p>
            All subscription fees are billed in advance and are non-refundable once activated, except as required under mandatory statutory consumer protection laws.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. Data Ownership & Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            You retain 100% full ownership of all site inspection records, safety audit logs, uploaded worker photos, PPE stock inventories, and contractor registration data created in your workspace.
          </p>
          <p>
            AmerisPro retains all intellectual property rights in the platform software architecture, UI design system, search algorithms, and brand assets.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>4. AI Search & Analytics Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            AmerisPro includes automated AI search and statutory compliance assistance tools designed to help organizations reference safety legislation, codes of practice, and regulatory guidelines.
          </p>
          <p>
            <em>Disclaimer:</em> Automated legal summaries and AI search responses are provided for informational and internal compliance tracking purposes only and do not constitute formal legal counsel.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by law, AmerisPro shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from site safety incidents, external statutory enforcement actions, or workplace audit outcomes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>6. Support & Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For questions regarding these Terms of Service or billing inquiries, please contact our support team at: <a href="mailto:support@amerispro.com" class="legal-link">support@amerispro.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <footer class="legal-footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 AmerisPro. All rights reserved.</p>
      </footer>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 48px 20px 80px;
    background: #FFF9EC;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
    color: #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 3px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 44px;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-header {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .legal-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: #FFD166;
    border: 2px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-subtitle {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #4A4E69;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #6C757D;
  }

  .legal-body {
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #2B2D42;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #333333;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #333333;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .legal-link {
    color: #2B2D42;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-footer {
    border-top: 2px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding-top: 20px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #6C757D;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-container {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .legal-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
  }
</style>
